<title>BELGIUM: TABLE - Belgian firm investment up 13.1 pct in April.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Belgian firm investment up 13.1 pct in April.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgium's National Statistics Office released the following data on corporate investment, calculated from VAT returns, for April -</p>
<p>    COMPANY INVESTMENT     Apr 1997   March     Apr 1996</p>
<p>    Index (base 100=1985)  198.0	197.4     175.1</p>
<p>    Yr/yr pct change	 13.1	 -3.3</p>
</text>
